{"parentUuid":"bacc8b82-e19d-4e66-bf29-80281d74f654","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnwWUhz2zBZYWygYwBp5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2764,"cache_read_input_tokens":444400,"output_tokens":1680,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":290},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2764,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1680,"cache_read_input_tokens":444400,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2764,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2764},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":11010,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"f6abeb55-2273-4e29-96f4-efa01dae58a8","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgnwWUJBLDw6FnLZFMo9q","requestRef":"d8846dc7-bde6-4549-b92c-722a21634de0","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"d4700a00-d650-4606-a3d2-0e8d5e3a4b55","timestamp":"2026-11-07T04:31:37.030Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/demo-fixes","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
{"parentUuid":"d4700a00-d650-4606-a3d2-0e8d5e3a4b55","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnwWUhz2zBZYWygYwBp5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**The demo now runs on Valmet's scene, and the full route to P-005 looks excellent, but none of it is on `main` until PR #10 is merged.** [PR #10](https://github.com/Sairanyx/Newbies/pull/10) passes CI and needs your go-ahead, since merges have needed your explicit OK.\n\nThe final walk looks near-photographic from start to pump, with no clipping through anything by eye. It ends on a clear view of the two pumps on their plinth: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-viktor-trilar-Projects-Newbies/6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028/scratchpad/floor_v2/walk_final.jpg`\n\n## What changed\n| Area | Now |\n|---|---|\n| **Scene** | Valmet's uncleaned `Equipment Room.ply`, with light versions for the tablet |\n| **Objects** | 440 with cleaner outlines, including whole pumps; 302 labels carried over from my AI review (not checked by a person) |\n| **Viewer** | Draws routes, walks them, ends looking at the target, and re-plans when something moves |\n| **Copilot** | New panel with sources and health data; refuses restart and bypass requests it used to miss; quotes real trends (flow 83 to 65%, pressure 4.9 to 4.5 bar) |\n| **Floor** | 11.3 m² connected at 0.6 m wide; 4.3 m route to P-005, stopping 0.5 m away |\n\nThe backend passes 12 of 12 checks on a fresh `make scene`, and all 143 tests pass (2 skipped).\n\n## Corrections to what I told you\n- **The black holes:** I first blamed removing faint splats, but that barely matters. The size and isolation filters did the damage, taking our splat from 22.32 to 16.59 dB. Cleaning is now marked as analysis-only.\n- **The re-run:** I said to drop it based on the object counts, then reversed that once I saw the crops. It covers fewer splats, but its pumps come out whole.\n- **Real-frame labelling:** I recommended this as the top label gain, and it failed. Our video lines up with Valmet's scene across the room, but not closely enough for single objects, so I removed it.\n- **A false \"verified\" label:** my first upload marked `obj-0049` as verified. I fixed that within minutes, before anything used it.\n\n## Still not tested or confirmed\n- **Real hardware:** nothing has run on the 5090 or a tablet. Browser tests used software rendering, and only `light_400k`.\n- **Full original scene in the viewer:** not yet loaded in our viewer. It may need `?lod=0`, or `light_full.ply` as a fallback.\n- **P-005:** `obj-0049` is still a visual pick at confidence 0.3. Its box covers both pumps, and someone needs to confirm which one it is.\n- **Live re-route:** the viewer shows refusals and undo. I only tested it with a cart that fully blocks the aisle, so it still needs a spot where a detour exists for the demo.\n- **Scale:** that the scene is in metres is still unproven.\n\n## To run it on the 5090\nPut `Equipment Room.ply` in `data/scene/equipment_room/` and the Excel pack in `data/`, then:\n```\ngit switch viktor/demo-fixes    # or main, once merged\nmake scene mapping db api\nmake web SCENE=\"data/scene/equipment_room/Equipment Room.ply\" ASSETS=data/scene/equipment_room/assets_mapped.json SHAPES=data/scene/equipment_room/shapes.json\n```\n`make api` keeps running, so start `make web` in a second terminal. Then click **Go to P-005**, **Walk route** and **Copilot**.\n\nDelete the `objects-v1`, `objects-v2`, `scene-v2` and `views-v1` Releases before the repo goes public.\n\n**Next steps:**\n1. Merge PR #10, and run the commands above on the 5090. That rehearsal is the biggest remaining risk.\n2. Ask Valmet's engineer which pump is P-005.\n\nShould I merge PR #10 now?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2764,"cache_read_input_tokens":444400,"output_tokens":1680,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":290},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2764,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1680,"cache_read_input_tokens":444400,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2764,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2764},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f6abeb55-2273-4e29-96f4-efa01dae58a8","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgnwWUJBLDw6FnLZFMo9q","requestRef":"d8846dc7-bde6-4549-b92c-722a21634de0","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"d565a834-f200-49ad-af2a-699cf365400b","timestamp":"2026-11-07T04:31:42.297Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/demo-fixes","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
