{"parentUuid":"84e05143-f670-467b-9630-f16f16ddecde","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"edb501c8-b207-444c-a130-abc58639ac92","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 1\nassets_mapped.json\nQwen3.5-4B.json\nQwen3.5-9B.json\n===== Qwen3.5-4B.json\n\nQ: Why is P-005 flagged?  [template, 3.7s]\n why template: citations not in the facts: ['[ASSET-017] process pressure bar', '[ASSET-017] process flow pct']\n rejected: {\n\"answer\": \"P-005 is flagged because its health score is 44.0 with an attention_required state and a high urgency level due to efficiency loss.\",\n\"hypotheses\": [\n\"Efficiency loss / fouling-like signature observed in synthetic diagnostic context.\",\n\"Decreasing process pressure and flow over 20 sampl\n\nQ: Why is P-005 flagged, and what should I check first?  [model, 3.0s]\n A: P-005 is flagged due to a high health score of 44.0 and an efficiency loss signature recorded in diagnostic alerts. The recommended first check is to inspect the hydraulic path. Follow site lockout/tagout procedures and permits (DOC-FIELD-SAFETY).\n H: ['Efficiency loss caused by fouling-like signatures observed in synthetic diagnostic contexts.', 'Process pressure and flow rates are decreasing over recent samples.']\n C: ['ASSET-017', 'EVT-00962', 'EVT-00959', 'EVT-00953', 'CASE-025', 'CASE-044', 'DOC-FIELD-SAFETY']\n\nQ: What's wrong with this pump?  [model, 2.3s]\n A: The pump shows a health score of 44.0 with an efficiency loss and fouling-like signature recorded in the system. Follow site lockout/tagout procedures and permits (DOC-FIELD-SAFETY).\n H: ['Efficiency loss due to fouling', 'Process pressure and flow are decreasing over 20 samples']\n C: ['ASSET-017', 'EVT-00962', 'EVT-00959', 'EVT-00953', 'DOC-FIELD-SAFETY']\n\nQ: Which measurements have changed recently?  [template, 2.7s]\n why template: citations not in the facts: ['[ASSET-017]', '[EVT-00962]', '[EVT-00959]', '[EVT-00953]']\n rejected: {\n\"answer\": \"Process pressure is now 4.509 bar and decreasing over 20 samples, while process flow is now 64.557% and also decreasing over 20 samples.\",\n\"hypotheses\": [\"Efficiency loss due to fouling-like signature indicated in diagnostic alerts.\", \"Hydraulic path issues suggested by the recommended \n\nQ: Why would falling flow point to fouling here?  [template, 3.4s]\n why template: citations not in the facts: ['[ASSET-017] process flow pct: now 64.557, range 63.347 to 83.191, decreasing over 20 sampl\n rejected: {\n\"answer\": \"Falling flow points to fouling because the asset's current flow percentage is decreasing over 20 samples while the issue code is recorded as FOULING.\",\n\"hypotheses\": [\n\"Efficiency loss / fouling-like signature observed in synthetic diagnostic context.\",\n\"Decreasing process flow percenta\n\nQ: What happened the last time this was serviced?  [model, 2.8s]\n A: The last service was a bearing inspection recorded on 2026-06-23T23:00:00 with no fault found. Follow site lockout/tagout procedures and permits (DOC-FIELD-SAFETY).\n H: ['Previous seal inspections occurred on 2026-05-15, 2026-04-12, 2026-03-21, and 2026-01-24.', 'Recent diagnostic alerts suggest efficiency loss or fouling-like signatures.']\n C: ['WO-00012', 'DOC-FIELD-SAFETY']\n\nQ: What should I check next, and why?  [model, 2.6s]\n A: You should check the hydraulic path next because the asset has a fouling-like signature and efficiency loss recorded in its current state. Follow site lockout/tagout procedures and permits (DOC-FIELD-SAFETY).\n H: ['Efficiency loss caused by fouling', 'Process pressure and flow are decreasing over time']\n C: ['ASSET-017', 'EVT-00962', 'EVT-00959', 'EVT-00953', 'CASE-025', 'CASE-044', 'DOC-FIELD-SAFETY']\n\nQ: Has this kind of problem happened before?  [model, 2.5s]\n A: Yes, the issue code FOULING has occurred historically on this asset class. Follow site lockout/tagout procedures and permits (DOC-FIELD-SAFETY).\n H: ['Efficiency loss / fouling-like