{"parentUuid":"ebe05f6f-74e5-407c-a0a4-d967d627496f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgo9BtSrwJJk6T81oCwzp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Everything is finished and waiting on you: nothing is running on Roihu, and two PRs are ready to merge.**\n\n| Item | Status |\n|---|---|\n| `main` (`e46babe`) | Has Valmet's scene, the new objects, route drawing, the copilot panel and the copilot safety fixes |\n| PR #11 (transformers 5) | Open, can merge, CI passes |\n| PR #12 (Qwen copilot) | Open, can merge, CI passes |\n| Roihu | No jobs running. Disk is at 242 of 250 GB, and your cert runs to 20:41 today |\n| My local work | Clean, on `viktor/copilot-llm` |\n\n**To finish, in order:**\n1. **Merge #11, then #12.** Say the word and I'll do it, or merge them yourself.\n2. **On the 5090, while it still has internet,** run `make scene mapping db` and `make model`. It also needs `Equipment Room.ply` in `data/scene/equipment_room/` and the Excel pack in `data/`.\n3. **Rehearse offline on the 5090 and a tablet.** This is the biggest remaining risk, since the viewer with the full scene, the model and the tablet have never run together.\n4. **Ask Valmet's engineer which pump is P-005.** `obj-0049` is still my unconfirmed pick.\n\n**Still to do once those are done:**\n- Find a spot where moving a cart produces a real detour, so the live re-route shows on stage.\n- Make the demo video and slides, and fill in the \"Pre-existing work\" section of the README. I haven't checked where any of these stand.\n- Confirm the deadline. Eduard's doc says submit Sunday 09:00, deadline 10:00, but that's unconfirmed.\n\nShould I merge the two PRs now?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":645,"cache_read_input_tokens":513409,"output_tokens":677,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":79},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_