{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","hash":"20a30d6a5ca4dac166efc8ee7dfdefceeb7cffeb2fff5bf5d1e2577075058fb6","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A real mouse drag now works end to end: the cage moved, the backend logged it, the route re-planned from 4.31 m to 5.56 m, and undo restored everything. Next I'll look at how it appears on screen.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VvZTiWd8Erm1mdRLkVhcJi","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-viktor-trilar-Projects-Newbies/6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028/scratchpad/drag_2.png"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015Ld6ELyzcf6DZrRfrjZ9tB","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies; S=/tmp/claude-1000/-home-viktor-trilar-Projects-Newbies/6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028/scratchpad; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/RESULTS.md'; t=open(p).read().rstrip('\\n')\nt+='''\n| 2026-11-07 | Viktor | Moving real objects (`app/scene/split_movable.py`) | Uncleaned `Equipment Room.ply`, chair and roll cage | Everything in the box above the floor | Objects move whole, leaving a dark patch, not a hole. Cutting by label distance left ghosts. Real mouse drag of `obj-0067` to (-1.46, -1.75): route to `obj-0049` went from 4.31 to 5.56 m, undo restored it. Not all objects suit this: a cart with neighbours in its box takes them along | | | Roihu L40, headless browser |\n'''\nopen(p,'w').write(t)\np='handoffs/viktortrilar.md'\nopen(p,'w').write('''# viktortrilar: viktor/moving-splats\n**Goal:** dragging a movable object moves the real thing in the scan, and bends the route\n**Done:** app/scene/split_movable.py and `make pieces` cut chosen objects out of a scene. Viewer loads them and moves them with the drag (web/objects.js). serve.py and `make web` take `PIECES=`. Re-plans keep the route's start (web/route.js). PRs #10, #11, #12 merged: main has Valmet's scene, routes, and the Qwen copilot\n**Verified:** lint; tests. Real mouse drag on a light scene with software rendering: `obj-0067` to (-1.46, -1.75), route 4.31 to 5.56 m, undo restores. Renders of the chair and cage moved 1 m look clean. Not tested: on the 5090, tablet, or the full scene in the viewer\n**Next:** merge this PR. On the 5090: `make scene mapping db model pieces`, then rehearse offline. Add an \"Add obstacle\" button and written directions. A person confirms P-005 on obj-0049\n**Blockers:** none. Cert valid to 2026-11-07 20:41. Local branch viktor/viewer-objects holds an unused merge: don't merge it\n''')\nEOF\nmake lint 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-50; uv run --no-project --with numpy --with scipy --with pandas --with openpyxl --with pytest --with fastapi --with httpx --with pillow --with 'psycopg[binary]' pytest -q 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-80; make -n pieces 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-150; git add app/scene/split_movable.py tests/test_split_movable.py web Makefile docs/RESULTS.md handoffs/viktortrilar.md; git status --short | grep -v \"^[AM] \" | head -4; git commit -qm \"Move real objects in the scan when dragged, and keep the route's start on re-plans\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\"; git log --oneline -1 | cut -c1-80; git fetch -q origin; git merge origin/main --no-edit 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-60; git push -q -u git@github.com:Sairanyx/Newbies.git viktor/moving-splats 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-40; gh pr create --head viktor/moving-splats --base main --title \"Move real objects in the scan when dragged\" --body \"$(cat <<'BODY'\n## Changes\n- `app/scene/split_movable.py` and `make pieces`: cut chosen objects out of a scene. Uses positions only, so it works on the full scene and lighter copies.\n- The viewer loads each piece, and moves it with the drag. Without `PIECES=`, nothing changes.\n- Re-plans keep the route's start, so looking around from elsewhere can't change the route.\n\n## Verified\nReal mouse drag in a headless browser on a light scene: `obj-0067` to (-1.46, -1.75) bends the route to `obj-0049` from 4.31 to 5.56 m, and undo restores it. Renders of the chair and cage moved 1 m look clean, leaving a dark patch.\n\n**Not tested:** the 5090, a tablet, or the full scene in the viewer.\n\n**Limit:** anything else inside an object's box moves with it, so this only suits free-standing objects. Defaults are `obj-0067` and `obj-0008`.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nBODY\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-70; sleep 20; gh pr checks 13 2>&1 | cut -c1-30 | head -2","description":"Record results, run all tests, commit, push and open the PR","timeout":150000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
