{"parentUuid":"40c035e9-8191-430b-8ab4-4f2053b98358","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgoAt1tpP3TeKw8aMXwzq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2998,"cache_read_input_tokens":549426,"output_tokens":1128,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":92},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2998,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1128,"cache_read_input_tokens":549426,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2998,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2998},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":9023,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"0d357130-bf03-49a8-a8e9-4c60626bc0fc","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgoAt14CrHbty8foTdGru","requestRef":"c789eb49-2cfa-4284-abcb-de7fd188f60a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"cc8502b8-e069-4cb3-9619-8414c0b2e1af","timestamp":"2026-11-07T07:26:54.379Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/moving-splats","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
{"parentUuid":"cc8502b8-e069-4cb3-9619-8414c0b2e1af","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgoAt1tpP3TeKw8aMXwzq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**The one-cart test worked, so dragging now moves the real object and the route visibly bends around it.** It's in [PR #13](https://github.com/Sairanyx/Newbies/pull/13), with CI passing, but not merged yet. PRs #11 and #12 are merged, so `main` has the Qwen copilot.\n\nIn the browser test, the blue route to P-005 clearly detours around the moved roll cage. That screenshot is low resolution because this laptop uses software rendering: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-viktor-trilar-Projects-Newbies/6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028/scratchpad/drag_2.png`\n\n## The demo move\nFrom the room centre (the route's start), plan to P-005, then drag the roll cage (`obj-0067`) about 0.9 m onto the route, to (−1.46, −1.75):\n\n| Step | Result |\n|---|---|\n| Before | 4.31 m route |\n| Real mouse drag | The cage moves, the backend logs it, and the route bends to **5.56 m** |\n| Undo | Back to 4.31 m |\n\nOther drop spots block the aisle entirely, which shows the refusal with its reason, so you can demo both.\n\n## What changed\n- **`make pieces`** cuts chosen objects out of any scene version. It defaults to the roll cage and the green chair, the two that looked clean.\n- **The hole problem is much smaller than I feared.** The scan saw the floor under these objects, so what's left behind is a dark patch rather than a hole.\n- **Re-plans now keep the original start,** so you can look around or view from above while dragging without the route changing for the wrong reason.\n\nAll tests pass (161, with 2 skipped).\n\n## Limits\n- **Only two objects move as real splats.** The other 57 movable ones still move as an outline or shape. Anything else inside an object's box moves too, so a cart with its neighbours in the box takes them along. I can add more, but each needs checking by eye.\n- **Not tested:** the 5090, a tablet, or the full scene in the viewer. Two extra pieces should be cheap, but I haven't measured it.\n- **Dark patch:** visible if the camera looks at the old spot. I'd frame the shot on the route and the moved cage.\n\n## To run it on the 5090\nOnce #13 is merged, while it still has internet:\n```\nmake scene mapping db model pieces\nmake api\nmake web SCENE=data/scene/equipment_room/cut/base.ply ASSETS=data/scene/equipment_room/assets_mapped.json SHAPES=data/scene/equipment_room/shapes.json PIECES=data/scene/equipment_room/cut\n```\n`make api` keeps running, so start `make web` in a second terminal.\n\n**Next steps, as I'd order them:**\n1. Merge #13. Should I do it?\n2. Rehearse the whole flow on the 5090 and a tablet, offline. Everything is now built for the full demo, and nothing has been run together on real hardware.\n3. Then the small additions: an \"Add obstacle\" button and written directions. Voice comes after those, if time allows."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2998,"cache_read_input_tokens":549426,"output_tokens":1128,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":92},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2998,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1128,"cache_read_input_tokens":549426,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2998,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2998},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0d357130-bf03-49a8-a8e9-4c60626bc0fc","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgoAt14CrHbty8foTdGru","requestRef":"c789eb49-2cfa-4284-abcb-de7fd188f60a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","prom