{"parentUuid":"abc4396e-e65e-4ae6-8e8b-d9a2818529da","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgoGiCH4mqds6nzYgs2VV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1559,"cache_read_input_tokens":738462,"output_tokens":1445,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":326},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1559,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1445,"cache_read_input_tokens":738462,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1559,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1559},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":10158,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"32c172c0-c436-4609-885d-11ec920c9092","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgoGiBgqr3aTPN8n3TvMH","requestRef":"4e911260-4eae-4b7d-b9cc-7823a53e741a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"aaf18112-e5d1-4553-8de1-882a64aed239","timestamp":"2026-11-07T08:43:24.750Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/numbers","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
{"parentUuid":"aaf18112-e5d1-4553-8de1-882a64aed239","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgoGiCH4mqds6nzYgs2VV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Roihu first:** it isn't just Roihu. Puhti and Mahti, also at CSC, don't answer on SSH either, while LUMI does, and CSC's website loads. So either CSC's SSH is down, or it's blocking this network's address, which could be my repeated connections or the venue's shared IP. I can't tell which, and I've stopped retrying. **Try a phone hotspot**, and if that doesn't work, check CSC's status page.\n\n**Your teammates:** yes, mostly `make`, but two files aren't downloadable and have to come from your Drive folder, because they're Valmet's and stay out of git.\n\n## Everyone\n```\ngit pull\ngh auth login      # once, since the Releases are private\nmake scene         # objects, labels, shapes, floor map, light scenes (about 125 MB)\n```\nThen put these in place by hand:\n- `Equipment Room.ply` goes in `data/scene/equipment_room/`\n- The Excel pack goes in `data/` as any `.xlsx` file\n\n## What else, by role\n| Who | Commands | For |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Viewer only** | `make pieces`, then `make web` | Moving objects |\n| **Backend or copilot** | `make mapping db api` | Excel links, database, API. `make db` needs Docker. Run `make mapping` before `make api` |\n| **The 5090 (demo machine)** | All of the above, plus `make model` | The Qwen copilot. About 20 GB, so run it with internet |\n\nTo start the viewer afterwards:\n```\nmake web SCENE=data/scene/equipment_room/cut/base.ply ASSETS=data/scene/equipment_room/assets_mapped.json SHAPES=data/scene/equipment_room/shapes.json PIECES=data/scene/equipment_room/cut\n```\n`assets_mapped.json` comes from `make mapping`, so run that first. A tablet should use the lighter scene instead: `make pieces PIECES_FROM=data/scene/equipment_room/light_full.ply` before the same command.\n\n## What they should skip\n- **`make scene-full`:** our own splat, which we're no longer demoing.\n- **`make views`:** old renders from the damaged cleaned scene.\n- **`make floor`:** `make scene` already includes a good floor map, and rebuilding without the render folders brings back blocked aisles.\n- **`make pipeline`:** not on `main` yet, and it needs a GPU machine.\n\n## Things to warn them about\n- **Object IDs changed.** Anyone with older data should rerun `make scene` and `make mapping`. P-005 is now `obj-0049`, not `obj-0046`.\n- **`uv run` downloads a lot.** The first `make` command that uses it installs the full GPU environment, which takes several GB, so do it on good Wi-Fi.\n- **I tested the steps separately.** I ran `make scene` and mapping from a clean download, but no one has run this exact sequence on a fresh machine. Whoever does it first should tell you what breaks.\n\nOnce Roihu is back, I'll carry on with the precision sample and the rest. In the meantime, I could do the local-only work, like merging `viktor/numbers` once you've OK'd it. Do you want that merged now? It adds the route check and `make pipeline`, and all 188 tests pass, though CI hasn't run because no PR is open for it yet."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1559,"cache_read_input_tokens":738462,"output_tokens":1445,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":326},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1559,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1445,"cache_read_input_tokens":738462,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1559,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1559},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"32