{"parentUuid":"9c9be767-4d3c-43bf-b530-2ae6328ce67b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgoGzZs3Xd623juiCnLfo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Still no connection: Roihu, Puhti and Mahti all time out on the hotspot too, so it isn't our network or a block on the venue's IP.** It looks like a problem at CSC's end, though I can't confirm that. CSC's service breaks page loaded, but I couldn't read its current notices from here, so please check it yourself: https://research.csc.fi/service-break/\n\nHitting CSC more won't help, so I've stopped retrying. You can go back to the venue Wi-Fi if you want, and I'd use `ssh -4` on Roihu from now on, because the IPv6 address fails on networks without IPv6.\n\n## What's blocked and what isn't\n| Work | Needs | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| 60-object precision sample | Masks on Roihu | Blocked |\n| Reviewing the 138 ungraded objects | Masks on Roihu | Blocked |\n| Second pass for unframed objects | Roihu GPU | Blocked |\n| Real `make pipeline` run | GPU, plus SAM | Blocked |\n| Bigger copilot test | A GPU with Qwen | **Could run on the 5090** |\n| Merging fragments and grouping pipes | Local files | **Can do now**, but needs a visual check later |\n| Fixing the blended confidence answer, and the copilot's built-in P-005 fallback | Code only | **Can do now** |\n| **5090 rehearsal** | Your 5090 | **Not blocked at all** |\n\nRoihu's scratch folder holds the masks, so if CSC stays down, those steps wait. The Releases are on GitHub, so **your demo isn't affected**: `make scene`, `make model` and everything in the demo work without CSC. `make model` downloads from Hugging Face.\n\n## What I'd do now\n1. **Rehearse on the 5090.** This outage is a good moment for it, since it's the biggest risk anyway and needs nothing from CSC.\n2. **Run the 60-question copilot test on that machine too.** I'd write the questions now, and it can run after `make model`.\n3. **Meanwhile, I'll do the local work:** grouping pipes and fragments, and the two copilot fixes, then open a PR for `viktor/numbers`. Once CSC returns, I'll verify the grouping visually and run the rest.\n\nI'll start on 3 now unless you'd rather I did something else. Does the 5090 have someone available to start the rehearsal?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1705,"cache_read_input_tokens":742411,"output_tokens":1217,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":410},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1705,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1217,"cache_read_input_tokens":742411,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1705,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1705},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3f873bb6-e4a7-40fb-bc8b-beef16221929","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgoGzZAN3T8JMfpcQKDq1","requestRef":"d356580b-ec38-41c5-b15c-88bd6ac23a8e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"43c637c8-bd3b-46e4-8418-59b4288f973c","timestamp":"2026-11-07T08:47:09.094Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/numbers","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
