{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","prNumber":14,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Sairanyx/Newbies/pull/14","prRepository":"Sairanyx/Newbies","timestamp":"2026-11-07T08:57:06.897Z"}
{"parentUuid":"2e101ed6-9a50-4332-9b1f-f0b330448a51","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgoHmaE7ikc8DRoKuubxn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**CSC is still unreachable, so the Roihu steps are paused, but I've finished the local work.** [PR #14](https://github.com/Sairanyx/Newbies/pull/14) is open with CI passing, and 189 tests passed locally (2 skipped) before the last formatting-only commit.\n\n## `main` is failing CI right now\nHannu's latest commit (`e2ff8da`) went directly to `main`, and it adds `skills/system/run-workflow/SKILL.md`, which fails the format check. The app code isn't affected, but every new PR would fail on it until the fix is merged. I formatted that one file in PR #14, whitespace only. It looks like an AI-assistant skill file rather than project code, so **ask Hannu whether it was meant to be committed.**\n\n## What PR #14 has\n- **Route check:** 383 of 384 routes touch fewer than 10 solid splats.\n- **`make pipeline`:** runs a scene from one config file, and ends with a report of what still needs a person. It has only had a dry run, since a real run needs CSC.\n- **Viewer settings:** it reads the fault tag and up direction from the assets file. A scene with a different up direction has never actually run.\n- **Copilot:** its default device now comes from `COPILOT_FAULT_TAG`.\n\n## What the grouping test showed\nI measured this but didn't apply it, because it would have made the object list worse:\n- **Merging fragments:** 39 pieces would merge into larger objects, reducing 440 to 401. But that would absorb 3 pumps and 3 valves into bigger boxes, so it has to match labels first.\n- **Pipe runs:** joining touching pipes gives a 6 m blob of 32 pieces, so it needs pipe direction as well.\n\nBoth need a visual check on Roihu before I'd trust them. I also didn't fix the copilot's blended confidence answer. The last prompt change made answers worse, and I can't retest the model until CSC is back. For now, avoid that question live.\n\n## Next\n1. **Merge #14.** Should I? It also clears the failing check on `main`.\n2. **Find out why CSC is unreachable.** Ask a teammate whether they can log in to Roihu. If not, email servicedesk@csc.fi, mentioning that SSH to Roihu, Puhti and Mahti times out from two different networks while LUMI answers.\n3. **Rehearse on the 5090.** Nothing about it depends on CSC. I can also write the 60-question copilot test now, to run on the 5090 after `make model`.\n\nWhen CSC returns, I'll run the precision sample, label review, grouping check and second-pass framing. Roihu's masks aren't backed up anywhere else, so those steps have to wait for it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1091,"cache_read_input_tokens":753667,"output_tokens":903,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1091,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":903,"cache_read_input_tokens":753667,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1091,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1091},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"524ad013-b888-40f9-89fc-416189bc52f0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgoHmZmqfDTxDoD6ZLwTp","requestRef":"3ee8f77b-ac4b-4d8c-aeec-915d0a249584","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"03f8fab3-642d-4791-ade7-462c1244b4d0","timestamp":"2026-11-07T08:57:15.459Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/N