{"parentUuid":"85c5fe88-01fa-4476-9b4f-31bb2cbadfc6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgoJtdTQ5j3s69X3iZ3WF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**No, the backend and viewer aren't tied to Roihu.** Nothing in `app/`, `web/` or the Makefile mentions Roihu or CSC. The only external addresses in that code are XML schema names used to read Excel files, which are labels and not network calls. So the demo should run on the 5090 even with CSC down, but that's from reading the code: it hasn't actually run on the 5090 yet.\n\n## Where everything comes from\n| Part | Source | Needs Roihu? |\n|---|---|---|\n| API, routing, copilot, viewer | This repo, running on the 5090 | No |\n| Objects, floor map, light scenes, `members.npz` | GitHub Release `objects-v2`, via `make scene` | No |\n| `Equipment Room.ply`, Excel pack | Your Drive folder | No |\n| Qwen model | Hugging Face, via `make model` | No |\n| Database | Local, via `make db` | No |\n\nOnce those downloads are done, the demo needs no internet at all. The JavaScript libraries are also in the repo, so the viewer doesn't use a CDN.\n\n## Where Roihu still matters\nOnly for offline work, not the running demo:\n- **Masks and full renders:** `data/masks_v3` and the render folders exist only on Roihu. The precision sample, label review, grouping check and second pass all need them, as would rebuilding the floor map with floater removal.\n- **Roihu job scripts:** the three `scripts/roihu_*.sbatch` files only run on Roihu.\n- **`make pipeline`:** not tied to Roihu, but it needs a GPU and the SAM mask tool. Those are currently only set up on Roihu, so the 5090 would need its own copy.\n\n**One risk:** those masks and renders aren't backed up anywhere else. If you want to redo extraction without CSC, the 5090 would have to re-render and re-segment from scratch, which is possible but means setting up SAM there first. It's worth copying them off once CSC returns; they're small (the masks are about 25 MB).\n\n## Done\nPR #14 is merged, and `main` (`1b1dd93`) passes CI again. The docs are updated, with tasks for each person and the demo steps in [docs/PLAN.md](docs/PLAN.md), under \"Now\". The team can `git pull` and start from there.\n\nThe next step is the 5090 rehearsal. Do you want to run it, or should Eduard set it up, as in the plan?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1003,"cache_read_input_tokens":766748,"output_tokens":806,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1003,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":806,"cache_read_input_tokens":766748,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1003,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1003},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"52cb1ff5-60f1-472a-b32c-e03ab0539973","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgoJtcsvv6Y2piUA2PGGL","requestRef":"8a1a9f06-3f1e-4682-a94d-eb868a14a2ff","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"e6194615-68cf-49af-b4b0-a1cee14adc31","timestamp":"2026-11-07T09:11:57.860Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"main","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
