e refused, and small real overlaps allowed. Existing saved changes aren't rechecked on restart. Added objects aren't checked on saving, only warned about.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nBODY\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-70; sleep 22; gh pr checks viktor/move-collisions --watch --interval 8 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-30; git log --oneline -1 | cut -c1-70; timeout 18 ssh -4 -o BatchMode=yes -o ConnectTimeout=12 -o \"CertificateFile=$PWD/cert(13).pub\" vtrilar@roihu-cpu-login1.csc.fi \"echo roihu-connected\" 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-90","description":"Run all tests, commit, open the PR, and recheck CSC","timeout":170000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"39e51a55-fe9e-4118-8224-cea39e1431a4","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgoNxbDnqbkPnbg3vCoXi","requestRef":"b9076c76-88ac-4650-a045-7b2374325c7c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"474c561f-52dd-4c4f-8093-99796e133d81","timestamp":"2026-11-07T10:05:21.314Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/move-collisions","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
