ate.combining===null\")); print('errors',errs); b.close()\nEOF\nT=\"$S/make_test\"; SCENE_ASSETS=\"$T/assets_mapped.json\" SCENE_GRID=\"$T/nav_grid.npz\" nohup uv run --no-project --with numpy --with scipy --with fastapi --with uvicorn --with pydantic --with openpyxl --with pandas --with pillow --with 'psycopg[binary]' uvicorn app.api.main:app --port 8001 > \"$S/api.log\" 2>&1 &\ncd /home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies; S=/tmp/claude-1000/-home-viktor-trilar-Projects-Newbies/6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028/scratchpad; T=\"$S/make_test\"; nohup python3 web/serve.py --scene \"$T/light_400k.ply\" --assets \"$T/assets_mapped.json\" --shapes \"$T/shapes.json\" --port 8123 --host 127.0.0.1 > /dev/null 2>&1 &\nsleep 14; cd /home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies; S=/tmp/claude-1000/-home-viktor-trilar-Projects-Newbies/6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028/scratchpad; timeout 240 uv run --no-project --with playwright python \"$S/tap_test.py\" 2>&1 | grep -v \"^  \\|Traceback\\|Installed\" | tail -5 | cut -c1-210; fuser -k 8123/tcp 8001/tcp >/dev/null 2>&1; python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\np='docs/PLAN.md'; t=open(p).read()\nt=t.replace(\"| **Viktor** | Run the 5090 rehearsal. Ask Valmet which pump is `P-005`. Confirm the deadline. Find out why CSC SSH is unreachable |\",\"| **Viktor** | Run the 5090 rehearsal. Ask Valmet which pump is `P-005`. Confirm the deadline |\")\nt=t.replace(\"| **Sasha** | Score the 60-object precision sample once CSC is back. Extraction slide and technical note. Retire or merge the old extraction branch |\",\"| **Sasha** | Score the 60-object precision sample, from crops rendered on the 5090. Extraction slide and technical note. Retire or merge the old extraction branch |\")\nt=t.replace(\"| **Coding agents** | Draft the README and notes from measured numbers, fix what the rehearsal finds, then run the sample, label review, grouping, and second pass when CSC returns |\",\"| **Coding agents** | Draft the README and notes from measured numbers, fix what the rehearsal finds, and prepare what the 5090 can run |\")\nt=t.replace('''**In order:** 5090''','''**Roihu is closed until at least Monday,** after the deadline, because of a security issue (CSC notice, 2026-11-07). Its masks, full renders, and video frames can't be reached, and any work needing them is off. Everything the demo needs is in Release `objects-v2`. Don't try to get around the closure. The 5090 is now our only GPU, so agree who's using it.\n\n**In order:** 5090''')\nt=t.replace(\"**Cut first if short of time:** voice mode, second-pass framing, pipe runs, written directions.\",\"**Cut first if short of time:** voice mode, written directions. Second-pass framing and pipe runs need Roihu's data or a SAM setup on the 5090, so they're off unless someone sets that up.\")\nopen(p,'w').write(t)\np='docs/RESULTS.md'; t=open(p).read().rstrip('\\n')\nt+='''\n| 2026-11-07 | Viktor | Frame overlap and object editing | Light scene, headless browser | Invisible faces hide lines behind each frame, drawn after the scan | Frames behind nearer boxes and a box's own back edges no longer show, with no holes in the scan. Split and Combine work with undo and reload. Saved parts move as outlines. `obj-0008` taken off the moving list after its star base went missing in a user's view | | | ThinkPad |\n'''\nopen(p,'w').write(t)\np='handoffs/viktortrilar.md'\nopen(p,'w').write(\"\"\"# viktortrilar: viktor/split-and-occlusion (includes PR #18)\n**Goal:** let operators correct objects: move safely, split, combine, and see frames clearly\n**Done:** collisions (PR #18). This branch: Split and Combine in the viewer and backend, frames hide what's behind them, `obj-0008` off the moving list. docs/USAGE.md updated\n**Verified:** lint; 205 tests passed, 2 skipped. Browser, software rendering, light scene: split, combine, reload, undo, cancel. Not tested: 5090, tablet, frame look on the full scene\n**Next:** merge PR #18 and this one. Rehearse on the 5090. Build the precision sample from crops rendered on the 5090, as Roihu's masks are out of reach\n**Blockers:** Roihu closed until at least Monday (CSC security notice), past the deadline. Its masks, renders, and frames can't be reached, and they had no other copy. A split or combined object's scan piece doesn't split with it. Local branch viktor/viewer-objects holds an unused merge: don't merge it\n\"\"\")\nEOF\nmake lint 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-50; git add app tests web docs Makefile handoffs/viktortrilar.md; git status --short | grep -v \"^[AMD] \" | head -3; git commit -qm \"Let operators split and combine objects, and hide frames behind nearer ones\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\"; git log --oneline -1 | cut -c1-80; git fetch -q origin; git log --oneline HEAD..origin/main | cut -c1-60 | head -4; git push -q -u git@github.com:Sairanyx/Newbies.git viktor/split-and-occlusion 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-30; gh pr create --head viktor/split-and-occlusion --base viktor/move-collisions --title \"Split and combine objects, and hide frames behind nearer ones\" --body \"$(cat <<'BODY'\nBuilds on #18, so merge that first.\n\n## Changes\n- **Split:** select an object, drag a box around one part. Code measures both parts, a vision model suggests a label, and the operator confirms.\n- **Combine:** select an object, press **Combine with...**, and tap a second. An orange box goes around both, to confirm.\n- Both keep working after a reload, and undo restores the originals. Objects linked to a record are refused, so a link can't be lost or guessed.\n- **Frames:** invisible faces hide lines behind each frame, so nearer boxes hide further ones and their own back edges.\n- `obj-0008` is off the moving list, as its star base went missing.\n- `docs/PLAN.md` reflects Roihu's closure.\n\n## Verified\nLint and tests. Headless browser on a light scene: split, combine with a real tap, reload, undo, cancel.\n\n**Not tested:** the 5090, a tablet, or how frames look on the full scene.\n\n**Limit:** parts of a split or combined object move as outlines, because its scan piece doesn't split with it.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nBODY\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-70; sleep 20; gh pr checks viktor/split-and-occlusion 2>&1 | cut -c1-28 | head -1; gh pr view 18 --json state,mergeable --jq '\"#18 \\(.state) \\(.mergeable)\"'","description":"Test a real tap, update the plan, commit, and open the PR","timeout":450000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b7f86737-8374-4428-9834-4765a728cfc3","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgoQGPdekUWujLh7QcG7v","requestRef":"d5e7f1cb-ed02-4120-87bb-da9b45c665cc","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"d93d3d6d-a173-4f9e-9d26-67175de0ab1e","timestamp":"2026-11-07T10:23:01.899Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/split-and-occlusion","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
