r movable objects\na18421c Highlight selected objects with segmented cyan splats\n# yasasha: yasasha/object-highlight\n**Goal:** Highlight selected scanned surfaces, not bounding boxes.\n**Done:** Added app/scene/highlights.py, web/highlight.js, serving routes, selection wiring, Makefile target, tests and usage docs. Exported 440 local highlights; cut movable objects use their whole piece (cart obj-0067: 1,091 -> 31,852 spl\n**Verified:** make check: 197 passed. Chromium checked real PLY loading, movement, undo, visibility, deletion, rapid selection and missing segmentation. Actual viewer selection hid the selected box; Boxes toggle preserved the surface. Cyan \n**Next:** Restart viewer after make highlights; review segmentation on the full room.\n**Blockers:** Fragmented objects remain separate; highlights cannot recover missing surfaces or confirm equipment identity.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"e89c3b91-c741-488d-86aa-731f69b130e0","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","root":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","branch":"viktor/split-and-occlusion","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Sairanyx/Newbies","visibility":"unknown"},"push_remote":null,"remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Sairanyx/Newbies","visibility":"unknown"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Sairanyx/Newbies","visibility":"unknown"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","platform":"linux"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"56085618-d8d2-402a-85d1-c7d522287ac9","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId"