{"parentUuid":"d292e0ac-b2c7-4944-88e2-e212aa474e14","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgoVN57AqpN3JSiyoDL2X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide is now up to date, but the fixes are in [PR #24](https://github.com/Sairanyx/Newbies/pull/24), which isn't merged yet.\n\nThe three gaps I fixed:\n- **Wrong count:** it still said four objects move as real splats, and it's now three.\n- **Live routes missing:** it didn't explain the route preview while dragging, the route arrows, or that a refused drop re-plans. It also said routes always keep the same start, which stopped being true.\n- **Walk and Fly missing:** this now matters, because in Walk mode the route starts from wherever you move to. The guide now says to switch to Fly to drag from a better view without changing the route.\n\nI also added two rows to the troubleshooting table: a route that jumps as you look around, and `obj-0008` with no star base, which comes from an old `cut` folder.\n\nIt's docs only. Should I merge it?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1718,"cache_read_input_tokens":887969,"output_tokens":289,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1718,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":289,"cache_read_input_tokens":887969,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1718,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1718},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"388d681f-8abe-4b64-a6d6-f008396fe55a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgoVN4ZRi3E3NbGcNFJ6k","requestRef":"0fc68740-629c-419d-b3e9-5eb462bc59df","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"ac2328f1-40c3-42d7-b073-6ff6ad696c06","timestamp":"2026-11-07T11:29:11.596Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/usage-update","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
