{"parentUuid":"d9a3a4e7-8e01-465c-9528-9746846803f4","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"67aee3ce-0b0c-48ee-9822-ff020ecab06d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n<pasted_content id=\"7ac0\">\nhttps://github.com/07LEE/gs-object-extraction\nGitHub\nGitHub - 07LEE/gs-object-extraction: Extract objects from 3D Gaussi...\nExtract objects from 3D Gaussian Splatting scenes and export them as standalone PLY files. - 07LEE/gs-object-extraction\nExtract objects from 3D Gaussian Splatting scenes and export them as standalone PLY files. - 07LEE/gs-object-extraction\nalpoer_5152 — 11:24 AM\nhttps://scantobimservice.com/point-cloud-to-bim-services/\nscantobimservice.com\nadmin\nPoint Cloud to BIM – 8+ Years of Accurate BIM Modeling\nWith 8+ years of experience, we deliver Point Cloud to BIM services, creating Revit and MEP models that improve coordination and support project workflows Pro.\nPoint Cloud to BIM – 8+ Years of Accurate BIM Modeling\nalpoer_5152 — 11:33 AM\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NNZbTlPJS60\nYouTube\nAtlas Industrial BIM\nScan-to-BIM Timelapse | Point Cloud to BIM Model | Industrial Facility\nImage\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qWe0iKOOHxc\nYouTube\nScantoBIM.Online\nFrom Point Cloud to 3D Walkthrough | Power Plant Scan to BIM Visual...\nImage\nalpoer_5152 — 11:47 AM\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AQHyML8-h0s\nYouTube\nDr. Florent Poux\n3D SCAN-TO-BIM Fully Automated: Point Cloud to IFC (Complete Workflow)\nImage\nIf we have access to a BIM model, generating a semantic floor layout from it would be even more valuable. This would give service workers an overview of the factory layout in advance, helping them understand the spatial organization and locate specific assets more efficiently.\nImage\npoint cloud is little bir nosiy to see from far perspective as you experience\nMika from Valmet — 12:01 PM\nLunch break 12-14\nShery90 — 1:04 PM\n@alpoer_5152 the challenge documentation does not specify any task weightage related to having a BIM model output. So is it safe to consider that this is kind of a nice to have requirement?\nAlpo — 1:12 PM\nYes, although it is not explicitly mentioned, this would improve usability and immersion while reducing the overall workload stress for service personnel. They can have overall factory spatial understanding over factory layout. İt gives bird eye view.\n</pasted_content id=\"7ac0\">\n\nThis is the discord chat alpo and mika are the representatives"}]},"uuid":"66879556-58fa-4a1d-9506-e86e3f238c86","timestamp":"2026-11-07T11:29:46.718Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":137,"turnIndex":180},"turnAttributionKey":"REDACTED","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/usage-update","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
